the issue of an order by a Veterinary Officer under Section 11;
(vii)
the tests to which an animal may be subject under Section 12;
(viii)
a post mortem examination of an animal under Section 13;
(ix)
the manner in which an animal may be dealt with under Section 19;
(x)
the enumeration of contagious diseases for the purposes of Section 19;
(xi)
the manner in which and the authority to which an appeal may be preferred under Section 22;
(xii)
the procedure for, and other matters (including fees) incidental to, the disposal of appeals under Section 22;
